<view class="page">
  <view class="title">记下这一句</view>
  <view class="hint">先写下来，之后可以随时补充、拍照，再让 AI 帮你展开。</view>

  <view class="card">
    <textarea
      class="editor"
      value="{{draft}}"
      maxlength="{{maxLength}}"
      placeholder="此刻想到什么？"
      placeholder-class="editor-placeholder"
      bindinput="onInput"
      auto-height
    />
    <view class="counter">{{draft.length}} / {{maxLength}}</view>
    <button class="button-primary" bindtap="onSave">保存</button>
  </view>

  <view class="placeholder">
    工程骨架版本：保存、补充、拍照与 AI 扩展均尚未实现。
    详细范围与验收标准见 openspec/changes/add-inspiration-mvp/proposal.md。
  </view>
</view>
